 Created by [@alexdotjs](https://twitter.com/alexdotjs).
+
+## New Feature: Date Range Filtering for Posts
+
+The posts API now supports filtering by date range. You can specify `fromDate` and/or `toDate` parameters when calling the `list` endpoint to retrieve posts created within a specific time period.
+
+### Usage Examples:
+
+```typescript
+// Get posts from the last 7 days
+const recentPosts = await caller.post.list({
+  limit: 50,
+  fromDate: new Date(Date.now() - 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000)
+});
+
+// Get posts from a specific month
+const monthlyPosts = await caller.post.list({
+  limit: 50,
+  fromDate: new Date('2023-01-01'),
+  toDate: new Date('2023-01-31')
+});
+
+// Get all posts (original behavior)
+const allPosts = await caller.post.list({ limit: 50 });
+```
+
+Both `fromDate` and `toDate` parameters are optional. When neither is provided, the behavior is identical to the previous version.
